00:00:00.650 --> 00:00:05.640
Speaker 1: The New York Times is now reporting
out of Brussels, the center of the euro, the

00:00:05.640 --> 00:00:11.940
head of the European Union, Americans, American
tourists who have been fully vaccinated against

00:00:11.940 --> 00:00:17.189
the coronavirus will be able to visit the
EU over the summer.

00:00:17.189 --> 00:00:22.640
We don't know when that will start, but this
is based on the head of the EU in an interview

00:00:22.640 --> 00:00:25.140
with The New York Times yesterday.

00:00:25.140 --> 00:00:29.829
It's been more than a year since nonessential
travel for most countries has been shut down

00:00:29.829 --> 00:00:30.829
to Europe.

00:00:30.829 --> 00:00:36.380
And the EU is saying that because the United
States is vaccinating so quickly and because

00:00:36.380 --> 00:00:42.140
talks have been advancing about how can we
accept vaccination certificates as proof of

00:00:42.140 --> 00:00:49.390
immunity, the EU and the EU Commission believe
that at some point during the summer now summer

00:00:49.390 --> 00:00:51.980
is technically, you know, it starts June 21st.

00:00:51.980 --> 00:00:57.140
They will be able to switch policy to one
that would restore the ability of Americans

00:00:57.140 --> 00:00:58.270
to go to Europe.

00:00:58.270 --> 00:01:03.900
Ursula von der Leyen, president of the E.U.,
says, quote, The Americans, as far as I can

00:01:03.900 --> 00:01:08.070
see, use European medicines, agencies, approved
vaccines.

00:01:08.070 --> 00:01:12.420
This will enable free movement and travel
to the European Union because one thing is

00:01:12.420 --> 00:01:19.560
clear, all 27 member states will accept unconditionally
all those who are vaccinated with vaccines

00:01:19.560 --> 00:01:30.590
approved by the M.A, adding that the vaccines
being used here, Moderna, Pfizer and JMJ are

00:01:30.590 --> 00:01:34.770
approved and and considered valid in the European
Union.

00:01:34.770 --> 00:01:39.560
No current timeline, but this is sort of a
top level statement.

00:01:39.560 --> 00:01:46.070
That guidance will be coming soon and it is
looking like we will be at 70 percent of adults

00:01:46.070 --> 00:01:50.210
