June.

00:01:50.210 --> 00:01:57.290
It will all be subject to the epidemiological
situation, but that it is improving in the

00:01:57.290 --> 00:02:02.200
US and we are starting to see an improvement
slightly in the European Union.

00:02:02.200 --> 00:02:08.899
Now, there are already some European countries
where you can go, you can go vaccinated to

00:02:08.899 --> 00:02:12.819
Estonia, you can go vaccinated to Iceland,
you can go to Croatia.

00:02:12.819 --> 00:02:18.989
There are some other Eastern European countries
where you can go, but it's relatively complicated.

00:02:18.989 --> 00:02:24.120
I have friends that have done it vaccinated,
and this seems to be a much broader discussion.

00:02:24.120 --> 00:02:31.000
The the guess is that this will include some
kind of reciprocity as well, where presuming

00:02:31.000 --> 00:02:37.090
that the numbers improve in Europe, the United
States will begin to do the same now.

